/* r = the comb multiplication of the 64 radix-16 digits of a scalar below 2^255, recoded inside with
   s2n-bignum's bias; digit i against table[i], which holds [1..8][16^i]B as twelve-word affine entries
   (Y+X, Y-X, 2dT); no doublings; constant time */
